{"ticker":"GM","updated":"2026-11-20T22:57:24Z","profile":{"longName":"General Motors Company","shortName":"General Motors Company Common Stock","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Auto Manufacturers","country":"United States","website":"https://www.gm.com","fullTimeEmployees":156000,"marketCap":66395774976,"trailingPE":17.223194,"forwardPE":5.3498583,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.35514876,"pegRatio":0.27,"targetMeanPrice":101.17391,"targetHighPrice":132.0,"targetLowPrice":75.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":23,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.029,"earningsGrowth":1.763,"grossMargins":0.11444,"operatingMargins":0.0683,"profitMargins":0.021170001,"totalRevenue":186952007680,"beta":1.418,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":93.7,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":68.19,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.88},"summary":"General Motors Company designs, builds, and sells trucks, crossovers, cars, and automobile parts worldwide. It operates through GM North America, GM International, and GM Financial segments. The company markets its vehicles primarily under the Buick, Cadillac, Chevrolet, GMC, Baojun, and Wuling brand names. In addition, it sells trucks, crossovers, cars, and automobile parts through retail dealers, distributors and dealers, as well as to fleet customers, including daily rental car companies, commercial fleet customers, leasing companies, and governments. Further, the company offers various range of after-sale services through dealer network, such as maintenance, light repairs, collision repairs, vehicle accessories, and extended service warranties. Additionally, it provides automotive financing; and software-enabled services and subscriptions. General Motors Company was founded in 1908 and is based in Detroit, Michigan.","summary_zh":"通用汽車公司在全球設計、製造和銷售卡車、跨界車、轎車和汽車零件。它透過通用汽車北美公司、通用汽車國際公司和通用汽車金融部門運作。該公司主要以別克、凱迪拉克、雪佛蘭、GMC、寶駿和五菱品牌銷售其車輛。此外，該公司還透過零售經銷商、分銷商和經銷商以及車隊客戶（包括日租汽車公司、商業車隊客戶、租賃公司和政府）銷售卡車、跨界車、轎車和汽車零件。此外，該公司還透過經銷商網路提供各種售後服務，例如維修、燈光維修、碰撞維修、車輛配件和延長服務保固。此外，它還提供汽車融資；以及軟體支援的服務和訂閱。通用汽車公司成立於 1908 年，總部位於密西根州底特律。","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"汽車製造商","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-22","o":58.78,"h":59.18,"l":58.46,"c":58.88,"v":7633800},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":59.05,"h":59.92,"l":58.46,"c":58.58,"v":5898800},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":60.1,"h":60.16,"l":59.06,"c":59.92,"v":10756100},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":59.53,"h":60.63,"l":59.11,"c":60.59,"v":7740100},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":60.65,"h":61.98,"l":60.46,"c":61.24,"v":8641400},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":61.85,"h":62.14,"l":60.75,"c":61.12,"v":9788400},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":61.71,"h":62.06,"l":60.55,"c":60.97,"v":6964800},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":60.94,"h":61.59,"l":60.13,"c":61.34,"v":8094400},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":61.48,"h":61.5,"l":59.21,"c":59.36,"v":9614600},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":59.32,"h":60.61,"l":58.67,"c":60.13,"v":13031900},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":59.94,"h":59.94,"l":58.13,"c":58.19,"v":8921500},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":58.63,"h":58.66,"l":56.63,"c":57.26,"v":10702900},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":57.33,"h":57.7,"l":56.24,"c":56.4,"v":5430000},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":56.78,"h":56.87,"l":55.91,"c":55.92,"v":5441800},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":56.24,"h":56.55,"l":55.22,"c":55.35,"v":5454400},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":55.9,"h":56.2,"l":55.35,"c":55.62,"v":3993600},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":54.51,"h":57.25,"l":54.33,"c":57.15,"v":9005000},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":57.26,"h":58.25,"l":57.01,"c":57.8,"v":7976900},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":57.89,"h":58.4,"l":56.81,"c":57.34,"v":6061300},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":57.73,"h":59.17,"l":57.55,"c":58.38,"v":7956200},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":58.54,"h":58.56,"l":57.68,"c":58.0,"v":10184600},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":63.76,"h":67.55,"l":62.36,"c":66.62,"v":43706500},{"t":"2025-10-22","o":67.05,"h":67.59,"l":65.89,"c":67.31,"v":18831900},{"t":"2025-10-23","o":67.97,"h":68.48,"l":66.57,"c":66.85,"v":12647200},{"t":"2025-10-24","o":67.46,"h":69.7,"l":67.29,"c":69.66,"v":12571000},{"t":"2025-10-27","o":69.57,"h":69.63,"l":68.79,"c":69.38,"v":9724800},{"t":"2025-10-28","o":69.46,"h":70